# CI stores Xcode DerivedData under `.ci-ios-test-dd` and uploads it as a workflow artifact.
# The iOS rule `Build` above matches that tree; un-ignore so `actions/upload-artifact` includes it.
!.ci-ios-test-dd/Build/
!.ci-ios-test-dd/Build/**
